@startuml context
' DOC: System context (C4 level 1 style). Status: [P] proposed.
title System Context — Beyblade-style Multiplayer Game [PROPOSED]
skinparam rectangleStyle rounded
actor "Player\n(desktop / mobile)" as Player
actor "Moderator" as Mod
actor "Admin / Owner" as Admin
rectangle "Game System" as SYS {
  rectangle "Game Client\n(Godot app)" as Client
  rectangle "Backend API" as API
  rectangle "Match Server(s)\n(headless Godot)" as MS
  database "MySQL" as DB
}
rectangle "App stores /\ndownload site [TBD]" as Store
rectangle "E-mail provider [TBD]\n(only if e-mail accounts)" as Mail
rectangle "Facebook group /\nMessenger [external,\nnon-authoritative]" as Social

Player --> Store : downloads client
Player --> Client : plays
Client --> API : HTTPS / WSS
Client --> MS : ENet over UDP [P]
MS --> API : internal HTTP (service auth)
API --> DB : SQL (private)
Mod --> API : moderation tools
Admin --> API : role & organizer approval
API --> Mail : verification / recovery [TBD]
Client ..> Social : opens link only (no API)
note bottom of DB : Never reachable from clients (SEC-001)
@enduml
